// Self-Healing PC Agent - Phase 12 (Approved Subprocess & Git) patcher.
//
// Usage (run inside your existing Phase 9, 10 or 11 project folder, e.g. C:\Projects\self-healing-pc-agent):
//   node PHASE_12_SUBPROCESS_GIT.mjs            -> apply the files
//   node PHASE_12_SUBPROCESS_GIT.mjs --dry-run  -> only show what would happen
//   node PHASE_12_SUBPROCESS_GIT.mjs --root=D:\path\to\project  -> apply elsewhere
//
// Safety rules built into every patcher:
// - Files are only ever written inside the target root folder.
// - Changed files are backed up first under .patcher-backups\PHASE_12_SUBPROCESS_GIT\<time>\.
// - Running it twice is safe: unchanged files are reported as SKIP.
// - Your .env file is NEVER touched. Nothing is deleted. No installs are run.

